WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.380
My family life in Jamaica, as

00:00:05.380 --> 00:00:09.180
I said, was more about my grandmother and
my mother.

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:12.120
I used to spend time in Kingston with my
mother.

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:17.660
And then when she got fed up with me, I'd
be sent back to the country.

00:00:18.580 --> 00:00:21.620
And when my grandmother got fed up with
me, she'd send me back to

00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:21.840
Kingston.

00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:27.400
So it was for a child that was great
because it's just back

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:27.900
and forth.

00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:32.900
And in Kingston it was just amazing, it
was just something else

00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:38.260
with all the cars and the noise and
everything, the music,

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:38.920
etc.

00:00:39.380 --> 00:00:42.260
Compared to in the country where you don't
care a lot of that.
